{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13214150","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13214150","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:3:1321415001:1":{"text":"또 온거냐? 숙취 해소제는 많이 마시면 안 돼!","source_cn":"你们怎么又来了？解酒的东西可不能多喝！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7095F8CE1777DB6A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1321415002:1":{"text":"아니요, 아니요! 저희는 사람을 찾으러 왔어요! 혹시 방금 전에 젊은 남자 못 보셨나요?","source_cn":"不不不，我们是来找人的！刚才有没有一个年轻男人经过这里？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6756AF3EB1413D03","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1321415003:1":{"text":"특징이라면... 옆에 있는 이 아이랑 좀 닮았고, 술 냄새가 났을 거예요.","source_cn":"外貌特点的话……嗯，他长得和我们身边这个小朋友有点像，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD7B893F913AC7940","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1321415004:1":{"text":"아, 방금 그런 젊은이가 지나가긴 했지.","source_cn":"噢，刚才的确有那么个年轻人经过。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8BE17DB15A182600","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1321415005:1":{"text":"지나갈 때 뭐라고 중얼거리던데... 분명 자기가 겁쟁이가 아니라는 말 같았어. 솔직히 들으면서 좀 어이가 없더군.","source_cn":"他过去的时候，还嘟嘟囔囔地说着什么，好像是在说自己不是...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDAEF87606CAA8817","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1321415006:1":{"text":"그... 그럼 혹시 어디로 갔는지 아세요?","source_cn":"那、那您知道他去哪了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB128CFA587EA5514","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1321415007:1":{"text":"허허, 얘야, 광산에는 돌아다닐 곳이 많지 않아. 다른 출구로 갔겠지.","source_cn":"嘿，小伙子，矿洞就这么大，除了另一个出口，他还能去哪？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x79863693A6035D40","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1321415008:1":{"text":"다른 출구요? 거긴 <style=\"highlight\">고대 전장</style> 쪽이잖아요! 살아있는 시체가 나타난다고요!","source_cn":"另一个出口？！那边可是<style=highlight...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1CD894B473EA9135","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1321415009:1":{"text":"뭐... 뭐라고요?!","source_cn":"什……什么……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0659A04B95BFF9BA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1321415010:1":{"text":"마스터, 어서 쫓아가야 해요! 살아있는 시체를 만나면 큰일이라고요!","source_cn":"主人，我们得赶快追上他！万一碰到活死人就不好了！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xE69E92082013170A","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"마스터, 어서 쫓아가야 해요! 살아있는 시체를 만나면 큰일이라고요!","female":"마스터, 어서 쫓아가야 해요! 살아있는 시체를 만나면 큰일이라고요!","variant_male_record_index":"148755","variant_female_record_index":"148756","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1321415011:1":{"text":"저, 저도 같이 갈게요!","source_cn":"我、我要和你们一起去……！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x827752140C1DD334","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1321415012:1":{"text":"고대 전장은 위험하니까 가지 않는 게 좋아요. 형이 당신을 보면 오히려 더 걱정할 거예요.","source_cn":"古战场很危险，你还是不要去了吧？要不然你哥哥看到你也会...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC7584847C0C7547F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1321415013:1":{"text":"안 돼요! 형을 찾아야 한다고요. 설득하려고 해도 소용 없어요!","source_cn":"不行，我必须要去找哥哥！你们劝我也没用！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x219CD9FD2E14CB0F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1321415014:1":{"text":"아휴, 알겠어요. 대신 우리를 따라와야 해요. 절대 혼자 가지 말고요!","source_cn":"唉，好吧……那你得一直跟着我们，不许乱跑！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA7448FA5C2B085EA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:乌里扬娜":{"text":"울리야나","source":"乌里扬娜","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:小彼得":{"text":"피터","source":"小彼得","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":15,"localized_text_count":14,"speaker_count":4}}